      "text": "Welcome to the Biering Virology Lab Who we are: We are a virology research lab located in the department of Molecular Biology in the School of Biological Sciences at UCSD. What we study: We are fascinated by the interactions between viruses and their hosts. We aim to discover the mechanisms that drive viral pathogenesis. This area of research is crucial given the challenges faced in developing vaccines and therapeutics against emerging viruses. 1 of 7 Our lab is located in the Applied Physics and Mathematics building in the center of the UCSD campus.",
